  },
  "integration": {
    "summary": "Plug the gateway into the indoor unit's CN-CNT socket with the supplied cable, choose BACnet MS/TP or BACnet IP on the DIP switch, set the MAC address or IP, then write the _command objects (on/off, mode, setpoint, fan) and read the _status objects. One gateway per indoor unit.",
