        "name": "OnOff_status",
        "why": "Confirm the unit is running"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 0",
        "name": "SetPoint_status",
        "why": "Setpoint the unit is really using"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 1",
        "name": "RoomTemperature",
        "why": "Room/return temperature for trending"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BI 1",
        "name": "ErrorActive",
        "why": "Unit alarm"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 2",
        "name": "ErrorCode",
        "why": "Which fault is active"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "No enable point is documented. BV 2 LockRemoteControl locks the remote controller.",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": null,
    "setup": [
      "A DIP switch selects BACnet MS/TP (default) or BACnet IP; changes apply after a power cycle.",
      "BACnet IP: factory static IP 192.168.100.246; change it or select DHCP in the configuration tool.",
      "MS/TP MAC address on SW2; default device instance 246000 (base + address in automatic mode).",
      "Use only the supplied 1.5 m cable to the CN-CNT socket."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "The Occupancy MV drives built-in logic; leave it at 3 (Disabled) if the BMS handles scheduling.",
      "Write the _command object and read the _status object."
    ]
  },
